WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.490
Oh no!

2
00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:07.297
A heap of notes from the stands, and Maya cannot tell which ones are happy and which ones are sad!

3
00:00:07.647 --> 00:00:10.808
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:11.158 --> 00:00:13.418
This is Episode 89.

5
00:00:13.768 --> 00:00:15.674
Meet the listening ear.

6
00:00:16.024 --> 00:00:17.508
Tap a note.

7
00:00:17.858 --> 00:00:19.639
The ear listens.

8
00:00:19.989 --> 00:00:21.280
Happy!

9
00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:23.512
Into the sunny jar.

10
00:00:23.862 --> 00:00:25.358
Tap another.

11
00:00:25.708 --> 00:00:26.998
Sad.

12
00:00:27.348 --> 00:00:29.254
Into the cloudy jar.

13
00:00:29.604 --> 00:00:31.636
It never gets mixed up.

14
00:00:31.986 --> 00:00:33.756
And it hears more.

15
00:00:34.106 --> 00:00:37.222
This note is happy, and it is about lemons.

16
00:00:37.572 --> 00:00:39.593
That one is about cups.

17
00:00:39.943 --> 00:00:44.509
A whole stack goes by, and the ear sorts every feeling and every topic.

18
00:00:44.859 --> 00:00:47.153
That is Amazon Comprehend.

19
00:00:47.503 --> 00:00:51.429
It reads words and understands the feeling and the meaning behind them.

20
00:00:51.779 --> 00:00:53.880
Now you know the listening ear!

21
00:00:54.230 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

